n)
Add the line of adding the absolute path of your script to the $PATH environment variable to the configuration file ~/.bashrc by using a text editor like nano

Command:

~$ nano ~/.bashrc

#then write this line at the bottom of the file

export PATH="$PATH:/home/yasseen/Downloads/Edges/Embedded_Linux_Diploma/Project1/Part(1)_Bash_Scripting/Script1"

#then ctrl+o then enter to save then ctrl+x to exit the nano text editor





o)
use the source command to make this change now in this terminal without reopening the terminal

Command:

~$ source ~/.bashrc


